%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (Barely looks up.) You're not faculty. Lost?
#
o_text: What do they teach here?
o_id: student_teach
o_goto: Teach
#
o_text: The woman at the gate. What's her story?
o_id: student_ines
o_goto: Ines
#
o_text: Never mind.
o_id: student_leave
