name: Teach
npc: Genomics, population health, "resource ethics". Second year you stop asking what the wall is for.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: teach_back
o_goto: Default

name: Ines
npc: Ines. Dropped out last term after her brother. Security has been told not to touch her. That order will not last.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: ines_back
o_goto: Default

name: End
npc: Sure.
effect: EndConversation
